WEBVTT

00:01.900 --> 00:06.530
I made a seven-hour trip all the way
to Tokyo from the Hiroshima countryside.

00:06.530 --> 00:09.900
It was a few days before
the start of high school...

00:19.010 --> 00:23.140
...I happened to see a girl
at my new school, and she...

00:29.960 --> 00:32.930
...was just marvelous...

00:32.930 --> 00:36.950
And I've never seen such a
beautiful girl like her in my life.

00:37.830 --> 00:43.070
Your profile looking up
towards the blue sky

00:43.070 --> 00:49.140
The stopped spiral of time

00:49.140 --> 00:55.720
I'm always stubborn
and hiding my feelings

00:55.720 --> 01:02.190
I ache for you so much
(I pine for you so much) that it hurts

01:02.190 --> 01:05.960
I'm not actually that strong

01:05.960 --> 01:13.370
In truth, I become afraid
about the distance between us two

01:13.370 --> 01:19.470
I want you to touch my heart

01:19.470 --> 01:25.180
If I can still reach the goal
taking the long way around

01:25.180 --> 01:27.080
Start line

01:27.080 --> 01:31.650
A story that unravels the heart

01:31.650 --> 01:37.690
I'll say goodbye to tears
and walk towards the future

01:37.690 --> 01:45.500
Because I can go with the kindness
I found clasped to my heart

01:45.500 --> 01:52.340
Please, just for now,
stay the way you are

02:04.620 --> 02:06.950
"Suzuka"

02:11.530 --> 02:14.190
Yamato is really late.

02:15.030 --> 02:18.800
Miho, you'll catch cold...
wait for him inside.

02:18.800 --> 02:22.500
But he said he'd come at two o'clock.

02:22.500 --> 02:27.780
I'm wondering if auntie told him
he couldn't go to high school in Tokyo...

02:27.780 --> 02:33.210
Don't worry. My sister said he can go
as long as he stays at my house.

02:33.210 --> 02:35.320
He's probably fooling around somewhere.

02:35.320 --> 02:38.990
He's so irresponsible, isn't he, Goro-chan?

02:38.990 --> 02:41.890
Sorry I'm late.

02:43.290 --> 02:46.090
Yamato Akitsuki has arrived!

02:47.960 --> 02:52.000
You're late, Yamato.
My little princess is angry.

02:52.000 --> 02:53.940
What?

02:53.940 --> 02:56.870
You're late, Yamato!

02:56.870 --> 02:58.940
You're such a big girl now, Miho!

02:58.940 --> 03:00.840
Are you starting the seventh grade?

03:00.840 --> 03:01.940
I'm entering eighth grade.

03:01.940 --> 03:05.450
You're a really careless person, Yamato!

03:05.450 --> 03:07.550
I know, I know, I really know!

03:07.550 --> 03:08.920
Geez...

03:08.920 --> 03:13.450
Wow, your mansion looks great
after the remodeling.

03:13.450 --> 03:15.160
A nice, big change, huh?

03:15.160 --> 03:16.990
The bath area was
renovated into a spa, too.

03:16.990 --> 03:18.990
It's very popular these days.

03:18.990 --> 03:22.030
This is my new home starting today...

03:22.030 --> 03:24.460
My new life is about to start!

03:26.530 --> 03:29.840
Well... Aunt Ayano,
I appreciate your taking me in.

03:29.840 --> 03:32.010
Stop being so formal, will you?

03:32.010 --> 03:34.380
Well, you're my landlady.

03:34.380 --> 03:37.310
Just make yourself at home...
we're relatives.

03:37.310 --> 03:40.550
Ah, your luggage is already in your room.

03:40.550 --> 03:42.150
You must be tired, Yamato.

03:42.150 --> 03:44.290
Let's go inside and take a rest.
Come on.

03:44.290 --> 03:45.020
Okay!

03:45.020 --> 03:50.980
"Anticipation"

03:53.660 --> 03:55.690
Your room is #301. It's upstairs.

03:55.690 --> 03:59.370
This complex is only
for females, though...

03:59.370 --> 04:02.170
Don't cause any trouble, Yamato.

04:02.170 --> 04:04.170
What do you mean, trouble?

04:04.170 --> 04:06.810
Well, Yamato should be fine.

04:06.810 --> 04:11.510
It's better than having no male help...
even someone like you.

04:11.510 --> 04:13.580
Come on, give me some credit at least.

04:13.580 --> 04:15.550
When I have something to get done,
I'm really responsible.

04:15.550 --> 04:18.980
And not only will I get free room
and board, I'll also get paid for work.

04:18.980 --> 04:21.220
So I'll do my best either
cleaning the bath or whatever.

04:21.220 --> 04:23.990
You know what?
Cleaning the bath is hard work.

04:23.990 --> 04:26.360
So don't give me any lip.

04:26.360 --> 04:30.020
It's a piece of cake! I have
confidence in my strength!

04:37.740 --> 04:43.340
Man... I thought it was easy,
but this really is hard work...

04:43.340 --> 04:47.580
Boy, there're Jacuzzis... and even saunas...

04:47.580 --> 04:52.680
This place seems to be very modern...
I bet young girls will come by...

04:53.690 --> 04:55.590
Maybe that girl will come over...

04:55.590 --> 04:58.060
Hey! You haven't filled the bath yet?

04:58.060 --> 05:00.660
You said it's piece of cake
cleaning the bath, right?

05:00.660 --> 05:02.830
You should keep your promise!

05:02.830 --> 05:07.200
I know, I'll finish in a minute!

05:07.200 --> 05:08.460
Something like this...

05:10.140 --> 05:11.970
Well, you'd better hurry or...

05:16.010 --> 05:17.080
Here they are!

05:17.080 --> 05:18.410
Customers?

05:18.410 --> 05:20.980
They're the college girls
who live in my complex.

05:20.980 --> 05:24.150
Be careful! They're really dangerous!

05:24.150 --> 05:25.340
Dangerous?

05:26.620 --> 05:29.820
Look, it's not ready yet.

05:29.820 --> 05:32.960
Really?

05:32.960 --> 05:37.260
Oh, is this Yamato? The one
the landlady was talking about?

05:37.260 --> 05:41.000
Huh? Is Yamato here?
Gosh, I'm embarrassed like this...

05:41.000 --> 05:45.370
Hmm... You're kind of cute, huh?

05:45.370 --> 05:46.740
Noooo!

05:48.310 --> 05:51.140
Yamato, get out of here right now!

05:51.140 --> 05:52.370
Ouch!

05:55.780 --> 05:57.980
S-Sor...

05:57.980 --> 05:59.180
Oh?

06:01.790 --> 06:04.450
Ah... well... I mean...

06:06.030 --> 06:08.460
N-No!

06:10.130 --> 06:12.830
This is just a big mistake!

06:12.830 --> 06:15.430
Geez, what bad timing!

06:15.430 --> 06:17.570
Well, I was wishing she would
come by, but not like this...

06:17.570 --> 06:20.840
Darn! She must despise me...

06:28.580 --> 06:31.020
Whoaaaa!

06:34.890 --> 06:35.750
Yamato?

06:35.750 --> 06:36.890
What's going on here?

06:36.890 --> 06:38.420
This guy suddenly...

06:38.420 --> 06:39.690
What?

06:39.690 --> 06:43.130
No! I was just going into my room...

06:43.130 --> 06:46.630
Yamato, look at the doorplate.

06:46.630 --> 06:50.740
This is Suzuka Asahina's room.

06:50.740 --> 06:52.970
Your room is over there, Yamato.

06:59.580 --> 07:03.480
You know, I just moved in here,
so I made a mistake!

07:03.480 --> 07:06.120
You're a such a careless person.

07:06.120 --> 07:08.680
I warned you not to cause any problems!

07:12.160 --> 07:16.730
I'm sorry, Suzuka.
You should apologize, Yamato!

07:16.730 --> 07:19.300
I-I'm sorry...

07:19.300 --> 07:23.100
Man... I never thought
she'd live right next door...

07:27.510 --> 07:30.410
You're a great cook, Ayano!

07:30.410 --> 07:34.850
Well, who knows what you'd be eating
if I didn't feed you.

07:34.850 --> 07:37.320
Hey, you make it sound like
I'm a dog or something...

07:37.320 --> 07:38.520
There's not much difference.

07:38.520 --> 07:41.150
You walked into someone else's room...

07:41.150 --> 07:43.620
No, I didn't...

07:43.620 --> 07:47.830
Thanks for inviting me to dinner.

07:47.830 --> 07:51.160
No problem, anytime, Suzuka.

07:51.160 --> 07:54.100
You treat us very differently...

07:54.100 --> 07:59.770
Of course. Suzuka is
everyone's hope, unlike you.

08:03.810 --> 08:09.050
Suzuka is amazing. She's an Aoba
high school freshman, like you.

08:09.050 --> 08:12.550
But she got scouted
by the track and field team.

08:12.550 --> 08:15.120
You meanwhile made it
from the waiting list.

08:15.120 --> 08:17.720
Scouted? Wow, that's impressive!

08:17.720 --> 08:20.520
That's why she was practicing,
even during spring break...

08:21.290 --> 08:24.860
Maybe she'll represent Japan someday.

08:24.860 --> 08:29.340
If so, I can boast that she
used to live in my apartment!

08:29.340 --> 08:31.300
I'll do my best.

08:33.640 --> 08:39.140
She's so cool... just perfect.
Are we really the same age?

08:39.140 --> 08:40.980
Suzuka, how about another bowl?

08:40.980 --> 08:42.750
Thanks, I'm fine.

08:42.750 --> 08:45.020
You have such a small appetite.

08:45.020 --> 08:46.350
I'll have another!

08:46.350 --> 08:49.090
You're eating well, Yamato.

08:49.090 --> 08:50.820
I'm a growing boy!

08:50.820 --> 08:53.530
By the way, I'm very impressed
that you were scouted!

08:53.530 --> 08:56.860
When I played baseball in junior high,

08:56.860 --> 09:00.000
I couldn't hit or field well
and everyone laughed at me.

09:00.000 --> 09:05.770
So I told everyone if I couldn't get a hit,
I'd buy juice for everyone.

09:05.770 --> 09:08.070
Then I was able to get a hit somehow.

09:08.070 --> 09:09.880
I guess you could say I'm a lucky fellow.

09:09.880 --> 09:12.010
That's so like you.

09:12.010 --> 09:13.840
You're an all-or-nothing person.

09:15.150 --> 09:18.450
What were you going to do
if you couldn't get a hit?

09:18.450 --> 09:20.520
Well, I didn't think
of anything in particular...

09:20.520 --> 09:22.090
Maybe say I'm sorry.

09:22.090 --> 09:26.790
I hate such irresponsible thinking.

09:26.790 --> 09:28.380
Thanks for dinner.

09:34.030 --> 09:37.560
That was a joke.
Don't take it so seriously.

09:41.070 --> 09:44.840
"Asahiyu"

09:53.920 --> 09:56.650
Miho... What's wrong?

10:05.130 --> 10:09.640
Umm... please don't hate Yamato.

10:09.640 --> 10:14.270
He's kind of clumsy and careless,
but he has some good traits.

10:14.270 --> 10:17.740
He's nice and good
at making okonomiyaki...
(Japanese-type pancakes)

10:17.740 --> 10:18.940
About earlier...

10:18.940 --> 10:21.380
Saotome was teasing Yamoto...

10:21.380 --> 10:26.750
...so, I pushed him.
That wasn't Yamato's fault at all.

10:26.750 --> 10:28.320
You came just to tell me that?

10:28.320 --> 10:30.260
Yes.

10:30.260 --> 10:32.560
You look after him, don't you?

10:32.560 --> 10:34.790
I can't leave people like him alone.

10:34.790 --> 10:36.730
Maybe it's some sort
of maternal instinct.

10:40.000 --> 10:41.130
I understand.

10:41.130 --> 10:42.800
Thank you!

10:42.800 --> 10:44.700
Oh?

10:44.700 --> 10:48.340
Is this guy... your boyfriend?

10:48.340 --> 10:50.480
Umm... he's just...

10:50.480 --> 10:52.670
I know! Someone you admire.

10:54.280 --> 10:56.280
He looks a little like Yamato.

10:56.280 --> 10:57.420
What?

10:57.420 --> 10:59.850
Don't be upset.

10:59.850 --> 11:03.190
Anyway, please don't hate Yamato!

11:13.600 --> 11:15.460
They don't look alike at all.

11:19.300 --> 11:24.180
Man, what's with Asahina?
Did I do something wrong to her?

11:24.180 --> 11:29.140
Well, I did... But she shouldn't
say something like that.

11:31.650 --> 11:34.920
C-Could it be... Asahina?

11:37.190 --> 11:39.950
Did she come to say sorry
about her comments?

11:41.790 --> 11:44.530
Good evening, Yamato!

11:44.530 --> 11:47.670
You shouldn't do this, Saotome!

11:47.670 --> 11:49.970
- I'm coming in!
- W-What's this?

11:49.970 --> 11:51.500
Let's do something fun!

11:51.500 --> 11:54.040
- Hey! Are you drunk?
- No, I'm not.

11:54.040 --> 11:56.110
Whoa! Your breath smells like alcohol!

11:56.110 --> 11:58.040
Ouch! Watch where you're walking!

11:58.040 --> 12:01.810
Saotome, why are you talking to the wall...

12:01.810 --> 12:06.350
No, I'm not talking to the wall.

12:06.350 --> 12:08.980
Hey, don't you have
any alcohol around here?

12:17.230 --> 12:18.530
Go drink, Yamato!

12:18.530 --> 12:20.270
Please stop it!

12:20.270 --> 12:24.070
Sorry, Yamato. I'll take her
back to her room now!

12:24.070 --> 12:25.670
Please!

12:25.670 --> 12:29.880
Megumi! That's why you
don't have a boyfriend!

12:29.880 --> 12:32.510
I don't understand
what you're talking about!

12:32.510 --> 12:34.740
Shut up and drink up!

12:37.520 --> 12:38.980
A-Are you all right?

12:38.980 --> 12:43.760
Oh? Not much left...
Did you drink this?

12:43.760 --> 12:45.720
This lady is crazy...

12:54.270 --> 12:57.740
Asahina-sempai! We hope you
do great in high school!

12:57.740 --> 13:00.040
We're all wishing for your success!

13:00.040 --> 13:05.810
Man, I'm surprised, Asahina. You cleared
the 169cm-high bar, didn't you?

13:05.810 --> 13:07.880
That's the best in Kanagawa!

13:07.880 --> 13:10.280
The principal is overjoyed, too!

13:10.280 --> 13:12.340
You are the pride of our school!

13:14.520 --> 13:21.630
169cm... I've gotten so much attention
and offers since that one jump...

13:21.630 --> 13:24.560
Everyone is expecting me to jump higher...

13:24.560 --> 13:29.190
So I have do better. And yet...

13:31.770 --> 13:33.470
Are you listening, Yamato?

13:33.470 --> 13:35.940
Yeah, yeah, I'm listening.

13:35.940 --> 13:38.380
Every guy who comes up to me is the same.

13:38.380 --> 13:41.180
They only look at my breasts, that's it...

13:41.180 --> 13:45.150
My name is Megumi Matsumoto!
My name is not Breast!

13:45.150 --> 13:47.890
Boy, this drunken lady is swearing at me.

13:47.890 --> 13:49.420
Listen to me!

13:49.420 --> 13:51.290
O-Okay!

13:51.290 --> 13:55.630
I bet you're looking at
my breasts as well, huh?

13:55.630 --> 13:57.630
N-No...

13:57.630 --> 14:01.070
Then go ahead and look... there!

14:01.070 --> 14:02.430
H-Hey, Megumi...

14:02.430 --> 14:03.870
What are you looking at!

14:06.170 --> 14:09.230
I need to slim down some more.

14:18.920 --> 14:23.250
Well, they finally went to sleep...
What should I do with them?

14:24.420 --> 14:27.520
Damn! It's already midnight!
I have to go clean the baths!

14:28.660 --> 14:31.730
Asahina must have heard all that noise.

14:31.730 --> 14:34.320
Oh well... She hates me already anyway.

14:39.240 --> 14:41.930
Darn, the lights are still on...

14:43.840 --> 14:46.510
Ayano will be angry with me again.

14:46.510 --> 14:48.570
Oh, the sauna is the same thing...

14:56.960 --> 14:58.460
Asahina?

14:58.460 --> 15:01.520
Hey! Are you all right? Asahina?

15:02.960 --> 15:04.990
Why can't I open this door!

15:06.730 --> 15:09.430
Asahina! Asahina! Hey!

15:09.430 --> 15:13.170
This is bad! I guess I have no choice...

15:14.810 --> 15:16.470
Sorry, Ayano!

15:18.980 --> 15:21.210
Asahina! Come on!

15:21.210 --> 15:22.610
Asahina!

15:26.320 --> 15:27.550
Don't worry.

15:27.550 --> 15:30.520
She was dehydrated,
but I gave her some water,

15:30.520 --> 15:32.490
and her temperature has gone down,
so she'll be fine.

15:32.490 --> 15:34.660
Good.

15:34.660 --> 15:40.370
You surprised me when you came in
half-crying and saying, "Asahina is dead."

15:40.370 --> 15:45.570
That's because she didn't
respond to me. I was in a panic.

15:45.570 --> 15:49.810
So was I, because the door of
the sauna bath was really broken.

15:49.810 --> 15:52.610
Well, I pushed, but it didn't open...

15:52.610 --> 15:56.250
You pull it to open the door.

15:56.250 --> 15:59.580
I was very upset... And I tried
to rescue her in a real hurry...

16:01.490 --> 16:05.220
Well, that's why I like you.

16:07.190 --> 16:09.260
Let me go clean up the bath.

16:09.260 --> 16:12.030
Will you give her some more water
when she wakes up?

16:12.030 --> 16:13.290
Okay.

16:15.130 --> 16:20.010
Sorry, Asahina. If I'd just
cleaned the bath a little earlier...

16:20.010 --> 16:22.940
That's okay.

16:22.940 --> 16:24.310
Are you already up?

16:24.310 --> 16:26.580
Because of your loud talking!

16:26.580 --> 16:30.140
Why did you break the door?
Are you crazy?

16:32.680 --> 16:38.660
You're the one who's crazy!
Why do you think I broke the door?

16:38.660 --> 16:40.690
I can't believe you stayed in
the sauna bath until you fainted!

16:40.690 --> 16:44.960
The instructions say the maximum time
is 12 minutes! You should read it!

16:44.960 --> 16:46.460
I did read it.

16:46.460 --> 16:48.400
Then you should follow it, stupid!

16:48.400 --> 16:49.730
Let me tell you something...

16:49.730 --> 16:52.600
I'm sorry! I know that.

16:52.600 --> 16:54.240
Huh?

16:54.240 --> 16:58.570
I thought if I could lose some weight,
I could jump higher!

17:00.050 --> 17:03.720
Team members,
school officials, parents...

17:03.720 --> 17:06.350
Everyone says the same thing
when they see me.

17:06.350 --> 17:08.490
Jump higher!

17:08.490 --> 17:11.860
It's not easy to jump 169cm!

17:11.860 --> 17:15.090
No one was more surprised
than I was by that jump!

17:15.090 --> 17:18.230
But everybody overestimates me,

17:18.230 --> 17:21.000
and somehow I felt the bar
looked higher and higher.

17:21.000 --> 17:23.970
I just felt... scared!

17:23.970 --> 17:25.530
Asahina...

17:29.340 --> 17:33.250
You know... I don't know
about track and field...

17:33.250 --> 17:36.110
And I don't know any secrets
about how to high jump.

17:38.850 --> 17:42.450
But you made it once...
So you'll be able to make it again.

17:42.450 --> 17:45.520
Huh? That's so thoughtless...

17:45.520 --> 17:49.660
Well, forget about the people
who say those things.

17:49.660 --> 17:53.700
You do the high jump
because you like it, right?

17:53.700 --> 17:55.900
Yeah, but...

17:55.900 --> 18:01.710
Then you should enjoy it instead
of doing it with a face like this.

18:01.710 --> 18:04.010
I don't look like that!

18:04.010 --> 18:08.880
See, you seem fine now.
So I'll go help Ayano...

18:08.880 --> 18:10.680
Wait!

18:10.680 --> 18:14.850
Listen, don't tell anyone that I cried!

18:14.850 --> 18:17.590
I don't know, you said a lot to me...

18:17.590 --> 18:21.790
Hey, promise you won't tell!

18:21.790 --> 18:22.890
Okay, okay.

18:22.890 --> 18:24.860
Then can you give me some water?

18:24.860 --> 18:25.660
Okay, okay.

18:25.660 --> 18:26.900
Can you change my towel?

18:26.900 --> 18:28.730
Don't get so carried away!

18:30.300 --> 18:35.260
I thought she was a cool person...
But she has her own problems...

18:36.270 --> 18:40.510
I feel like I understand her
a little better...

18:40.510 --> 18:44.320
Awwww... I'll still sleepy, Asahina.

18:44.320 --> 18:47.340
Why do I have to accompany
you on your morning training?

18:48.520 --> 18:51.360
Yamato, you told me I'd be
able to jump, remember?

18:51.360 --> 18:55.090
So you should be helpful until I jump!

18:55.090 --> 18:58.930
I didn't say I was responsible. Oh!

18:58.930 --> 19:01.370
What are you doing?!

19:01.370 --> 19:04.240
Sorry. What's the height?

19:04.240 --> 19:07.200
I'll start with 164cm.

19:09.310 --> 19:11.040
Oui, Madame.

19:11.040 --> 19:15.280
Hey! It's crooked!
Can't you do a better job?

19:15.280 --> 19:16.870
She nags so much.

19:19.580 --> 19:24.490
There it is. Can you make it?
It's pretty high!

19:29.630 --> 19:31.320
I'll show you!

19:35.170 --> 19:37.760
I'm always clearing...

19:38.840 --> 19:40.360
that height!

19:45.480 --> 19:48.000
Wow, she is so cool...

19:52.850 --> 19:56.020
Hey, you touched the bar.
It was very close.

19:56.020 --> 20:00.560
I can't believe it... I never
had a problem with this height...

20:00.560 --> 20:04.430
Well, everybody has a day like this...

20:04.430 --> 20:07.330
I've never... had a day like this!

20:07.330 --> 20:11.270
I know... You're still tired from yesterday...

20:11.270 --> 20:14.410
Just stop it! You don't have to say that.

20:14.410 --> 20:19.410
Cripes! I even have a problem
with 164cm, not just 169cm...

20:19.410 --> 20:21.550
What am I going to do?

20:21.550 --> 20:22.810
What?!

20:26.580 --> 20:28.950
W-Wait a minute!
How did you set the bar?

20:28.950 --> 20:31.660
Well, I thought I set it to 164cm.

20:31.660 --> 20:36.330
No, you're supposed to set the top part
of the bar at the 164cm mark, idiot!

20:36.330 --> 20:38.730
How am I supposed to know?!

20:38.730 --> 20:41.790
You're a really careless person!
Now what am I supposed to do?

20:44.670 --> 20:46.900
It's because of you, Yamato...

20:49.270 --> 20:52.680
I set my new record
without even realizing it.

21:07.790 --> 21:13.900
173cm... That unofficially ties
for 12th nationally all-time

21:13.900 --> 21:16.090
among junior high school girls.

21:17.370 --> 21:23.500
But more important... she seemed totally
different from her usual cool self.

21:25.080 --> 21:29.310
That was the cutest expression
I've ever seen.

21:40.590 --> 21:45.990
I'll become the wind
on the green field

21:45.990 --> 21:48.800
Right now, I'll just...

21:48.800 --> 21:55.940
Get a little "reckless"
and "fired up" and speed up

21:55.940 --> 21:56.600
Let's go

21:56.600 --> 21:57.370
Run

21:57.370 --> 21:57.970
Stop

21:57.970 --> 21:58.610
Advance

21:58.610 --> 21:59.310
Falter

21:59.310 --> 21:59.970
Jump

21:59.970 --> 22:01.940
Squat

22:01.940 --> 22:02.580
Sing

22:02.580 --> 22:03.240
Shout

22:03.240 --> 22:04.050
Triumph

22:04.050 --> 22:04.550
Fall short

22:04.550 --> 22:06.710
I'll live, right here

22:06.710 --> 22:12.150
Living recklessly like this
isn't altogether bad, either

22:12.150 --> 22:17.750
Something'll happen,
I have this feeling

22:19.490 --> 22:22.430
Day after day
of getting covered in bruises

22:24.870 --> 22:32.510
Some days, I feel my "limit", though...

22:32.510 --> 22:37.580
I'll become the wind
on the green field

22:37.580 --> 22:43.250
I'll run right through the moment

22:43.250 --> 22:48.390
The shapes of things change,
it's just the way it is

22:48.390 --> 22:51.090
You can't stop it...

22:51.090 --> 22:54.160
A little "stubborn" and "mischievous"

22:54.160 --> 22:58.000
"Competitive"

22:58.000 --> 22:58.670
That spirit

22:58.670 --> 22:59.330
Run

22:59.330 --> 23:00.000
Stop

23:00.000 --> 23:00.540
Advance

23:00.540 --> 23:01.170
Falter

23:01.170 --> 23:01.800
Jump

23:01.800 --> 23:04.040
Squat

23:04.040 --> 23:04.540
Sing

23:04.540 --> 23:05.210
Shout

23:05.210 --> 23:06.040
Triumph

23:06.040 --> 23:06.740
Fall short

23:06.740 --> 23:09.900
I'll live, right here

23:10.880 --> 23:17.290
You are so smooth. I can't believe you
flatter women just so you can be popular!

23:17.290 --> 23:20.890
Idiot, all women like compliments!

23:20.890 --> 23:21.260
"Next episode: Smile"
Idiot, all women like compliments!

23:21.260 --> 23:24.490
"Next episode: Smile"
I'm wondering if Asahina
wants to hear them, too?
